From 5805cfa124e3abd8a5064565ff83f5dc85bc1b3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tempest3 <konrad_f22@hotmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:31:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/16] nouveau/headers: update nvgpu/nvmap uapi to L4T R39.2

R39.2 inserted huge_page_size after big_page_size in
struct nvgpu_gpu_characteristics, shifting every later field (engine
classes read as garbage, so NVK rejected the GPU as pre-Kepler).
Take the headers from /usr/src/nvidia on an R39.2 rootfs and add the
<stddef.h> include they implicitly rely on for size_t.
---
